{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>ונשל</b> — Three times in the Masorah: ונשל ה' אלהיך את הגוים האלה מפניך · ונשל הברזל מן העץ · and the third is the one cited here. Had Israel not sinned, they would not have needed weapons, and this is the juxtaposition of ונשל גוים (the dispossessing of nations) with ונשל הברזל (the iron being removed from the tree)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:02.999423747Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}